OL,3,GNEWSAGatwick Airport facing water
OL,4,Aoutage after main burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FGatwick Airport passengers have been
OL,7,Fleft without water after a main burst
OL,8,Fin a nearby field.
OL,10,FSES Water said it had located a burst
OL,11,Fmain in a field in Horley, with parts
OL,12,Fof the airport left without water as a
OL,13,Fresult.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the airport
OL,16,Fconfirmed the issue was "affecting
OL,17,Fwater supply in both terminals and is
OL,18,Funder investigation by SES Water", but
OL,19,Fflights were not affected.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
